Derived from commit 0a7c1b1c110cc97ea9652d2fb1a7a7476b4be988
(internal/tools/mysql/<dir>/<dir>.go). The SQL statements, parameter names,
defaults and descriptions of these tools were ported; each ported file in
internal/tools names its origin in a header comment:

  list_tables                          mysqllisttables
  list_active_queries                  mysqllistactivequeries
  list_all_locks                       mysqllistalllocks
  list_table_fragmentation             mysqllisttablefragmentation
  list_tables_missing_unique_indexes   mysqllisttablesmissinguniqueindexes
  list_table_stats                     mysqllisttablestats (rewritten on performance_schema)
  show_query_stats                     mysqlshowquerystats

Changes from the originals: statements run through this project's read-only
executor, query text is redacted or limited to normalized digests, and
list_table_stats no longer reads the sys schema.
